          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "13:23 katika Kiebrania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwishowe, Abiya alifariki na kuzikwa katika mji wa Daudi na Asa mwanawe akatawala mahali pake. Wakati wa Asa, kulikuwa na amani nchini kwa muda wa miaka kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "14:1 katika Kiebrania.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa alitenda yaliyokuwa mazuri na mema mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliondoa nchini madhabahu za kigeni na mahali pa kuabudia miungu mingine, akabomoa minara na kuzikatakata sanamu za Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliwaamuru watu wa Yuda wamtafute Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa babu zao, na kuzitii sheria na amri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pia aliondoa mahali pote pa kuabudia miungu mingine na meza za kufukizia ubani kutoka katika miji yote ya Yuda; halafu ufalme wake ulikuwa na amani chini ya utawala wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alijenga miji yenye ngome katika Yuda wakati huo wa amani, na kwa muda wa miaka kadhaa, hapakutokea vita kwa maana Mwenyezi-Mungu alimpa amani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akawaambia watu wa Yuda, “Na tuiimarishe miji kwa kuizungushia kuta na minara na malango yenye makomeo. Nchi bado imo mikononi mwetu kwa maana tumeyatenda mapenzi yake Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, naye ametupa amani pande zote.” Basi wakajenga, wakafanikiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Asa alikuwa na jeshi la askari 300,000 kutoka Yuda, wenye ngao na mikuki, na wengine 280,000 kutoka Benyamini, wenye ngao na pinde. Wote walikuwa watu mashujaa sana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zera, Mwethiopia aliishambulia nchi ya Yuda akiwa na jeshi la askari 1,000,000 na magari 300, akasonga mbele hadi Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa alitoka akaenda kupigana naye. Pande zote mbili zilijipanga katika bonde la Sefatha karibu na Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo Asa akamlilia Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wake, akisema, “Ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, hakuna mwingine kama wewe, mwenye uwezo wa kulisaidia jeshi liwe dhaifu au lenye nguvu. Tusaidie, ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wetu, kwa kuwa sisi tunakutegemea wewe, na kwa jina lako tumekuja kupigana na jeshi hili kubwa ajabu. Ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, wewe ndiwe Mungu wetu; usimruhusu binadamu yeyote ashindane nawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwashinda Waethiopia mbele ya Asa na jeshi lake la watu wa Yuda. Waethiopia wakakimbia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa pamoja na wanajeshi wake wakawafuatilia mpaka Gerari, wakawaua Waethiopia wengi sana, asibaki hata mmoja, kwani walikuwa wamekwisha shindwa na Mwenyezi-Mungu pamoja na jeshi lake. Jeshi la Yuda lilichukua nyara nyingi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liliharibu miji yote iliyokuwa kandokando ya Gerari, kwa kuwa watu waliokuwamo katika miji hiyo waliingiwa na hofu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu. Jeshi lilichukua mali nyingi kutoka katika miji hiyo kwa sababu kulikuwamo mali nyingi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilishambulia pia wachungaji, likachukua kondoo wengi na ngamia. Kisha likarejea Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
